    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is full-funnel performance marketing for a diamond brand in Kolkata?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-funnel performance marketing = orchestrated paid + organic + owned across awareness → consideration → conversion → retention → LTV. For a Diamond + Solitaire brand in Kolkata: (1) Awareness — Meta + Instagram + YouTube + TikTok/Snapchat + Google Display + creator + PR + editorial. (2) Consideration — Meta + Google Shopping + PMax + retargeting + Pinterest (if occasion-driven) + creator UGC amplification. (3) Conversion — Meta catalog retargeting + Google Search + Shopping + WhatsApp CTWA + branded landing pages + skin/fit quizzes (if applicable). (4) Retention — Klaviyo email + SMS + WhatsApp routine/refill/subscription + winback + loyalty. (5) LTV — subscription + cross-sell + upsell + referral programme + brand community."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What LTV/CAC ratio + payback benchmarks for diamond in Kolkata?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Targets: LTV/CAC 3:1 minimum, 5:1 target, 8:1+ mature. Payback varies by category: 3-6 months (D2C beauty/wellness — fastest), 4-8 months (clothing — moderate), 6-14 months (jewelry + diamond — slowest due to inventory + consideration cycle), 2-6 months (toys — high repeat). First-order CPA: Rs 400-4,000 (India), AED 30-400 (GCC), £15-250 (UK) — higher CPL acceptable given high AOV × conversion rate = effective CAC. LTV context: 5-year LTV Rs 5-40L (India), AED 50K-1M+ (GCC), £15K-500K+ (UK) — high-value trust product, repeat rate lower but each purchase high-value. In Kolkata, wedding + peak-season cohorts show 2-5x LTV multiplier for jewelry + fashion + occasion-heavy sub-categories."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do cohort + attribution reporting work for a diamond brand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Weekly cohort dashboard: first-purchas