      <p class="lede">12 answer-first Q&amp;As on full-funnel performance marketing + ltv/cac/cohort attribution for Diamond, Solitaire, Engagement + Investment-grade Diamond Jewelry brands in Kolkata, India 2026 &mdash; costs in INR, CPL benchmarks, channel mix, creative velocity, attribution, and how ITD GrowthLabs runs performance marketing for entrepreneurs + founders + marketing managers.</p>
