    <div class="itdgl-pm-intro">
      <p>Full-funnel Performance Marketing + LTV/CAC/Cohort Attribution for Diamond, Solitaire, Engagement + Investment-grade Diamond Jewelry brands in Kolkata, India 2026 is where scaling B2C revenue is unlocked. Channel mix: Meta + Instagram + Reels + Google Search + Shopping + YouTube (education + reviews) + Pinterest (engagement + wedding) + Snapchat (KSA) + WhatsApp concierge. Peak-season concentration: Wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali (India), Ramadan + Eid + DSF + Dubai Jewellery Show (GCC), Christmas + Valentine's + engagement season (UK). For entrepreneurs, founders, and marketing managers running Diamond, Solitaire, Engagement + Investment-grade Diamond Jewelry brands in Kolkata, this guide answers 12 questions on Full-Funnel Performance + LTV/CAC — costs in INR, CPL benchmarks, creative velocity, attribution, and how ITD GrowthLabs runs Full-funnel Performance Marketing + LTV/CAC/Cohort Attribution for Diamond + Solitaire brands.</p><p>Reference AOV bands: India Rs 25,000-3 lakh (fashion diamond + light diamond), Rs 1L-15L+ (solitaire + engagement + investment-grade). GCC AED 2,500-50,000 (fashion diamond), AED 25,000-500,000+ (solitaire + engagement + investment + high-jewellery). UK £1,000-15,000 (fashion diamond + everyday), £5,000-150,000+ (engagement + solitaire + investment + high-jewellery). Ad range in Kolkata: Rs 1.5-10 lakh/month. CPL: Rs 400-4,000 (India), AED 30-400 (GCC), £15-250 (UK) — higher CPL acceptable given high AOV.</p>
